<title>HONG KONG: Leading Spirit says in talks on spinoff.</title>
<headline>Leading Spirit says in talks on spinoff.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading Spirit (Holdings) Co Ltd said on Wednesday it was holding discussions on spinning off its electronics arm and listing it in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Chairman Wong Shi Ling emphasised the talks were at a preliminary stage. &quot;The proposed separate listing may or may not proceed,&quot; he said in the statement issued through the Hong Kong exchange.</p>
<p>Leading Spirit supplies components for television, audio and household apppliances. Its shares rose HK$0.125 or 2.60 percent to HK$4.925 at midday on a volume of 13.70 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
